Package: simplefocstudio
Version: 0.0.0
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Maintainer: junchao98
Description: SimpleFOC Configuration Tool (Qt C++ Edition)
 A GUI tool for configuring and tuning SimpleFOC motor controllers.
 Supports real-time monitoring, PID tuning, motion control configuration,
 Arduino code generation, and serial communication.
Homepage: https://github.com/junchao98/SimpleFOCStudio-Qt
